        "id": 113796,
        "name": "Martin Tenbones",
        "username": "Martin_Tenbones",
        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/m/e5b9ba/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2017-07-05T15:36:43.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>As an alternative to Snap Decision, Augmented Ally combos beautifully with Fugue Parse - you get an extra power use so you can control the Villain deck with Extrasensory Awareness while still having a power open for Neural Processing, and the *cost* of doing so doubles the effectiveness of Neural Processing.&nbsp;</p>",
